WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Hello everyone, welcome back to the sourdough video.

00:40.000 --> 00:47.000
Mix 50 grams of flour with 50 grams of water for your sourdough starter.

01:10.000 --> 01:16.000
Mark the level of the sourdough starter on the jar.

01:40.000 --> 01:46.000
Feed the sourdough starter each morning with fresh flour.

02:40.000 --> 02:47.000
Check for bubbles and compare the marked level before feeding.

03:00.000 --> 03:07.000
Tell me which flour you use for your sourdough starter.
